+    param: Tuple[Tensor, Tensor, Tensor]
+        The parameters to cast.
+    dtype: torch.dtype
+        The dtype to cast the parameters to.
+
+    Returns:
+    --------
+    Tuple[Tensor, Tensor, Tensor]
+        The parameters with the corresponding dtype.
+
+    """
